      ],
      "title": "魔王降临·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23021001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这个是！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "这样的石头，根本打不破！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "看我的……呜！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "这种时候，还是交给我吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那么巨大的石头，竟然只是一瞬间……就被吃掉了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "好险，还是赶上了啊，要是这块石头再大一点，结果就不好说了。嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "噢噢噢噢！！出现了。超大型的手办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "猩猩",
          "text": "吼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这个又是什么东西啊？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "咦，我以为各位应该见惯了这种怪物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "才不可能见惯啊！我们也是第一次看到。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这个……就是这个家伙的研究吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "呵呵，现在拼尽全力反抗，取悦我带来的这些玩具吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "要是死的太快，你们连成为实验体的资格都不会有。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江，这种东西……要怎么打。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哈莉有办法！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "撤退，也是战场上必要的战术。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……虽然很丢脸，但是好像确实只能这样了，只有主人才能对抗这样的怪物吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不过人质我们也都救走了，现在撤退是最佳的选择！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23021021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "但是……他们好像没有这个想法？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-518",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "shilaimu",
          "rowIds": [
            23021001,
