        }
      ],
      "title": "魔王降临·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23022001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "只是看起来大一点的东西，没什么好怕的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "不过出现这种大家伙的话，应该可以好好玩玩了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "接下来就交给我们吧，请你们先到旁边休息一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "这是……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "飞，飞起来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "和龙王的那条龙一样，他们竟然都有飞行的能力吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "还有那家伙的涂装，也改变了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "果然不管怎么看，这种能力，也方便过头了吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "对付这种麻烦的家伙，果然还是认真一点比较好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23022011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "嘿嘿，那么，来……让我揍一拳吧！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "你们……竟然能够做到这种程度吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "被算计到确实出乎我的意料。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "不过你的准备如果只有刚才那个怪物，想要将我们抓住应该不太可能。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "少废话，这还不是结束。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "二号，三号！！将他们砸成圆饼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023006",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "猩猩",
          "text": "吼！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "为什么这些奇怪的手办会有这么多啊！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "嘿嘿，正好我还没有尽兴。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "优纪，你们在哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23023010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是主人！！我们在这！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-519",
      "sourceRefs": [
