      ],
      "title": "魔王降临·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23024001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这些是什么？还有这么大的手办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23024002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "人类！！什么时候……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23024003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "刚才解救人质的时候，我顺便就给主人发了通讯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23024004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不愧是和江。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23024005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔。和主人一比，那些大手办好像根本不够看了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23024006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "优纪是想说主人比他们还要可怕吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23024007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "才不会是这个意思，主人来了，会给人巨大的安全感。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23024008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "有主人帮忙的话，这些家伙就不够看了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23024009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "不用了，我来马上解决它。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23024010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "龙星扩散爆——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "又一次失败么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "明明只差一步，竟然出现了这种意外。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "是吗，但是在我看来，或许还差很多步。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "还有你现在才想着逃跑，不会觉得太晚了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "成王败寇。随便你怎么说都好，不过这只是开始。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "这些家伙本来也都是失败的试验品罢了，哼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "只可惜不能抓住你们继续推进研究，若是给我足够的时间，我的准备又何止这些。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘人",
          "text": "这次就放你们一马好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "说了这么多，是打算逃了吗？不会给你机会的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "利姆鲁",
          "text": "米莉姆……等等！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米莉姆",
          "text": "嗯？刚才放狠话的就是你这家伙？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒸汽唱片机",
          "text": "救，救命呀！不，不是我，我只是传话的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "不对，是陷阱！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那家伙根本就不在这里！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025015",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "轰——！！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23025016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "小心！！这家伙，在这里还准备了其他的机关，那些铁架要被推倒了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-520",
      "sourceRefs": [
